# CREDITS — First Bloom

A 39-second film in the Paper-cut Lightbox style, made entirely in code.
The potting shed, the camellia and the story are invented. No real brand or place is portrayed.

## Voice
Speech synthesis: Kokoro (kokoro-onnx), voice `af_heart`, English. Model and engine
are released under the licences of the kokoro-onnx project
(https://github.com/thewh1teagle/kokoro-onnx). Offline synthesis.

## Music
Original score, synthesised for this film (`music/score.py`).
Music box, koto and kalimba are physically modelled (`core/audio/pluck.py`).
No sample library.

## Typefaces
- Cormorant Garamond — SIL Open Font License 1.1 (Catharsis Fonts). Files copied from
  `demo/impasto/source/fonts`; see `fonts/OFL.txt`.

## Picture
Every frame is drawn with this film's paper-sheet engine (`engine/paper.js`, `world.js`).
No stock footage, no photographs, no third-party images.

## Sound effects
All foley is synthesised for this film (`mix.py`): night air, crickets, a match, paper,
a window chime, a pull-away whoosh.
